Security fixes from the PHP-5.3-security-backports branch of
https://github.com/shivammathur/php-src-backports (up to 0b939600a0fe), tests
and bundled libmagic changes left out, adapted to the PLD patch set.
Its memory_limit handling is reworked by php-5.3.29-CVE-2026-109618.patch.

